<title>FRANCE: Saint-Gobain nine-month sales up.</title>
<headline>Saint-Gobain nine-month sales up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					65,875   vs 51,797</p>
<p>NOTE - Saint-Gobain said in a statement the rise in sales over the 1995 period was 27.2 percent, due in particular to the integration of Poliet from July 1996.</p>
<p>It said that on a comparable structure basis the rise was 1.7 percent in French francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
